00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:01,640
I dag er siste sjanse.

2
00:00:01,920 --> 00:00:04,200
Akkurat i dag, tretti prosent rabatt.

3
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:05,960
Lageret går snart tomt.

4
00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:10,960
